{
  "scope": "Read-only 4.1/4.2 document and source audit; no adapter, planner, controller or simulator executed.",
  "source_document": "D:\\Desktop\\MARL项目\\资料\\需求与任务\\无人集群编队五类任务定义_1028.docx",
  "source_document_sha256": "10d75ee7d2d1bc1890dfdd4d7212cd3d56d0974ce9aec580d3825c43153acdb3",
  "source_locations": "Zero-based direct child index of word/document.xml w:body; not page numbers.",
  "sections": [
    {
      "body_index": 241,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "4.1 输入：上级任务消息"
    },
    {
      "body_index": 242,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "模型输入目前没有定稿，先给出一个最小消息信封，字段与任务描述字段对齐。它只解决“能把一条上级任务读进来并校验”，不解决消息去重、版本合并和跨消息依赖。"
    },
    {
      "body_index": 243,
      "kind": "table",
      "text": "字段 | 类型 | 说明\n版本号 | 字符串 | 消息版本，当前为0.3\n消息编号 | 字符串 | 消息唯一编号，用于追溯和去重\n下发时间 | 字符串 | ISO 8601时间\n来源 | 字符串 | 上级、调整、自主\n任务列表 | 数组 | 至少一条任务，每条与任务描述字段对齐"
    },
    {
      "body_index": 244,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "body_index": 245,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "单条任务字段：任务编号、任务类型、优先级、目标、时间窗、能力要求、最少/最多平台数、任务参数、约束、前置任务清单。任务类型用T-RCN等编码，时间窗用开始秒和结束秒。"
    },
    {
      "body_index": 246,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "最小输入示例："
    },
    {
      "body_index": 247,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "{"
    },
    {
      "body_index": 248,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "  \"schema_version\": \"0.1\","
    },
    {
      "body_index": 249,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "  \"message_id\": \"MSG-20261026-001\","
    },
    {
      "body_index": 250,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "  \"issued_at\": \"2026-10-26T10:00:00Z\","
    },
    {
      "body_index": 251,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "  \"source\": \"UPPER\","
    },
    {
      "body_index": 252,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "  \"tasks\": ["
    },
    {
      "body_index": 253,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "    {"
    },
    {
      "body_index": 254,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "      \"task_id\": \"T1\","
    },
    {
      "body_index": 255,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "      \"task_type\": \"T-RCN\","
    },
    {
      "body_index": 256,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "      \"priority\": 1,"
    },
    {
      "body_index": 257,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "      \"target\": {\"area\": [[0, 0], [2000, 0], [2000, 2000], [0, 2000]]},"
    },
    {
      "body_index": 258,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "      \"window\": {\"start_s\": 0, \"end_s\": 1800},"
    },
    {
      "body_index": 259,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "      \"required_capabilities\": {\"RCN\": 2},"
    },
    {
      "body_index": 260,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "      \"min_units\": 2,"
    },
    {
      "body_index": 261,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "      \"max_units\": 4,"
    },
    {
      "body_index": 262,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "      \"params\": {\"sensor\": \"EO\", \"coverage_required\": 0.9, \"duration_s\": 600}"
    },
    {
      "body_index": 263,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "    }"
    },
    {
      "body_index": 264,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "  ]"
    },
    {
      "body_index": 265,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "}"
    },
    {
      "body_index": 266,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "输入处理规则："
    },
    {
      "body_index": 267,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "1. 缺字段、空任务列表、未知任务类型、任务字段校验失败，一律拒绝，不静默丢弃。"
    },
    {
      "body_index": 268,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "2. 一条消息可以带多个任务；任务间依赖用前置任务清单，跨消息依赖暂不支持。"
    },
    {
      "body_index": 269,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "3. 平台标识与仿真机器人编号是两套标识，映射由编成表维护。"
    },
    {
      "body_index": 270,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "4. 输入只负责解析和校验；任务规则仍由五类任务定义统一维护，避免输入层和定义层各写一套。"
    },
    {
      "body_index": 271,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "4.2 输出：计划与机器人指令"
    },
    {
      "body_index": 272,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "模型输出分两层，计划层负责任务分配与仿真评估，执行层负责通过ROS话题发布机器人速度指令。cmd_vel是速度指令，不是“去某点/走某航线”的任务指令；计划层到执行层的转换由导航或控制模块完成。本文件只定义消息契约，不实现导航控制器。"
    },
    {
      "body_index": 273,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "机器人编号与话题："
    },
    {
      "body_index": 274,
      "kind": "table",
      "text": "类型 | 编号 | 话题 | 垂直速度\nUGV | 1–20 | /rover_01/cmd_vel至/rover_20/cmd_vel | 不支持\nTANK | 21–30 | /rover_21/cmd_vel至/rover_30/cmd_vel | 不支持\nPLANE | 31–40 | /rover_31/cmd_vel至/rover_40/cmd_vel | 支持\nWING | 41–50 | /rover_41/cmd_vel至/rover_50/cmd_vel | 支持"
    },
    {
      "body_index": 275,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "body_index": 276,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "输出示例："
    },
    {
      "body_index": 277,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "{"
    },
    {
      "body_index": 278,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "  \"plan_id\": \"PLAN-20261026-001\","
    },
    {
      "body_index": 279,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "  \"assignments\": ["
    },
    {
      "body_index": 280,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "    {"
    },
    {
      "body_index": 281,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "      \"unit_id\": \"U1\","
    },
    {
      "body_index": 282,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "      \"subtask_id\": \"T1-S1\","
    },
    {
      "body_index": 283,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "      \"task_type\": \"T-RCN\","
    },
    {
      "body_index": 284,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "      \"start_s\": 0,"
    },
    {
      "body_index": 285,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "      \"end_s\": 600,"
    },
    {
      "body_index": 286,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "      \"target\": {\"area\": {\"polygon\": [[0, 0], [1000, 0], [1000, 2000], [0, 2000]]}}"
    },
    {
      "body_index": 287,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "    }"
    },
    {
      "body_index": 288,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "  ],"
    },
    {
      "body_index": 289,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "  \"commands\": ["
    },
    {
      "body_index": 290,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "    {"
    },
    {
      "body_index": 291,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "      \"robot_id\": 1,"
    },
    {
      "body_index": 292,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "      \"topic\": \"/rover_01/cmd_vel\","
    },
    {
      "body_index": 293,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "      \"twist\": {"
    },
    {
      "body_index": 294,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "        \"linear\": {\"x\": 0.2, \"y\": 0, \"z\": 0},"
    },
    {
      "body_index": 295,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "        \"angular\": {\"x\": 0, \"y\": 0, \"z\": 0}"
    },
    {
      "body_index": 296,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "      },"
    },
    {
      "body_index": 297,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "      \"duration_s\": 5"
    },
    {
      "body_index": 298,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "    }"
    },
    {
      "body_index": 299,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "  ]"
    },
    {
      "body_index": 300,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "}"
    },
    {
      "body_index": 301,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "输入侧的区域是点列表；计划输出中的区域会包成“多边形”结构，这是内部表示，不影响输入契约。"
    },
    {
      "body_index": 302,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "速度指令约定："
    },
    {
      "body_index": 303,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "• 消息类型为geometry_msgs/msg/Twist，约20 Hz持续发布。"
    },
    {
      "body_index": 304,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "• linear.x为前进/后退，angular.z为转向；地面平台不使用linear.z，飞机31–50号可使用。"
    },
    {
      "body_index": 305,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "• linear.y、angular.x、angular.y保持0。"
    },
    {
      "body_index": 306,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "• 停止命令六个分量全为0；发布器退出或通信中断不等于停止，必须显式发送零速度。"
    },
    {
      "body_index": 307,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "• Twist本身没有持续时间字段，持续时间由发令程序管理，建议不超过120秒。"
    },
    {
      "body_index": 308,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "• 同一机器人只安排一个持续发令源；最小实现不提供命令超时自动停车。"
    },
    {
      "body_index": 309,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "• 位姿反馈走/model/rover_XX/pose，不是标准/tf树；本文件不规定位姿订阅实现。"
    }
  ],
